# Licensed BADA 4 TEM integration with cached ERA5 and per-aircraft envelopes.
# Run with: IC research/era5-tem-envelope
00:00:00.00>ECHO TEST INFO === ERA5 TEM ENVELOPE INTEGRATION GATE ===
00:00:00.05>ECHO TEST INFO ERAR and ERAO receive identical intent and ERA5 atmosphere.
00:00:00.10>ECHO TEST EXPECT ERA5 provenance and finite consistent atmosphere on every sample.
00:00:00.15>ECHO TEST EXPECT REPORT and OFF propagation remain equivalent with zero BADA misses.
00:00:00.20>DATE 15,8,2025,12:00:00
00:00:00.25>PLUGIN LOAD WINDECMWF
00:00:00.30>PLUGIN LOAD PYBADATEM
00:00:00.35>PLUGIN LOAD RESEARCHRECORDER
00:00:00.40>PERFMODEL BADA4
00:00:00.42>METEOCONFIG STRICT ON
00:00:00.43>METEOCONFIG TIMEUPDATE ON
00:00:00.44>METEOCONFIG INTERPOLATION OFF
00:00:00.45>WINDECMWF 40,-5,45,5
00:00:00.50>METEOSTATUS 41.3,2.1,FL100
00:00:01.00>CRE ERAR,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.00>CRE ERAO,A320-232,41.30,2.10,90,FL100,250
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS ERAR TEM
00:00:01.20>DYNAMICS ERAO TEM
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG ERAR PYBADA
00:00:01.40>BADACONFIG ERAO PYBADA
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS ERAR LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.60>ENVELOPECHECKS ERAO LONGITUDINAL
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE ERAR REPORT
00:00:01.80>ENVELOPE ERAO OFF
00:00:02.00>RECORDRESEARCH START era5-tem-envelope.csv
00:00:03.00>ALT ERAR FL120
00:00:03.00>ALT ERAO FL120
00:00:03.20>VS ERAR 1000
00:00:03.20>VS ERAO 1000
00:00:10.00>ATMOSSTATUS ERAR
00:00:10.00>ATMOSSTATUS ERAO
00:00:20.00>PERFSTATUS ERAR ALL
00:00:20.00>PERFSTATUS ERAO ALL
00:00:21.00>RECORDRESEARCH STOP
00:00:21.10>ECHO TEST INFO Run validate_era5_tem_run.py on output/era5-tem-envelope.csv.
00:00:22.00>HOLD
